OL,3,GNEWSACounty lines heroin and cocaine
OL,4,Adealers jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men involved in county lines drug
OL,7,Fdealing in South and West Yorkshire
OL,8,Fhave been jailed.
OL,10,FAccording to South Yorkshire Police,
OL,11,FShamas Mahmood, known as Curly, and
OL,12,FAmaad Zahoor would travel from West
OL,13,FYorkshire to Barnsley to deal heroin
OL,14,Fand crack cocaine.
OL,16,FBoth were caught by officers and later
OL,17,Fpleaded guilty to a number of drug
OL,18,Foffences at Sheffield Crown Court in
OL,19,FJune.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
