OL,3,GNEWSACounty lines heroin and cocaine
OL,4,Adealers jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the same court on Monday, Mahmood,
OL,7,F29 and of Rushton Road, Bradford, was
OL,8,Fjailed for five years and nine months
OL,9,Fwhile Zahoor, 28 and of Bridge Street,
OL,10,FBradford, was jailed for four years and
OL,11,Fsix months.
